system where operations check permissions on entities beyond the direct target (parent, children, ancestors, related resources). When code analysis reveals recursive or chain-based permission evaluation, the task planner should flag these operations for dedicated scope-of-check documentation sections.\\n\", \"path\": \"/workspace/.docwriter/meta/source-observations/SRC-OBS-006.md\"}"
